# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit real values.

# --- Supabase (optional, enables order / reservation / enquiry / message submission) ---
# Project URL and the PUBLIC "anon" key from Supabase → Project Settings → API.
# The anon key is designed to be public; row-level security protects the data.
# NEVER put the service_role key here or anywhere in frontend code.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# --- WhatsApp ---
# The café's number (919332740085) is built in (src/config/site.ts). Uncomment only to override it;
# an empty value switches WhatsApp off.
# VITE_WHATSAPP_NUMBER=
